msgid ""
"<strong>Note:</strong> If multiple carriers are activated while the "
"dimension checker is enabled, you’ll see this error: <i>\"One of the items "
"in your order is too large to be shipped to a service point. Search is "
"limited to your selected country.\"</i> This is why we recommend using "
"dimension checking only for PostNL and DHL service points."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bemærk:</strong> Hvis du har aktiveret flere transportører, mens "
"kontrollen af pakkemål er slået til, vises denne fejl: <i>\"One of the items "
"in your order is too large to be shipped to a service point. Search is "
"limited to your selected country.\"</i> Derfor anbefaler vi, at du kun "
"bruger målkontrollen til afhentningssteder hos PostNL og DHL."

msgid ""
"This feature is dependent on you having entered the correct dimensions for "
"all of your products in your WooCommerce admin environment. The example "
"below shows how to set up maximum dimensions in your WooCommerce product "
"settings:"
msgstr ""
"Funktionen kræver, at du har angivet korrekte mål for alle dine produkter i "
"WooCommerce-administrationen. Eksemplet nedenfor viser, hvordan du angiver "
"maksimale mål i produktindstillingerne i WooCommerce:"

msgid ""
"The service point picker will filter out carriers that cannot handle "
"products of that given size."
msgstr ""
"Vælgeren til afhentningssteder filtrerer de transportører fra, som ikke kan håndtere produkter i den pågældende størrelse."

msgid ""
"Please bear in mind that there is no advance packing logic behind this — we "
"simply check if all the given products in an order are within the maximum "
"dimensions of the carrier."
msgstr ""
"Funktionen tager ikke højde for, hvordan varerne pakkes. Den kontrollerer "
"kun, om alle produkter i en ordre holder sig inden for transportørens "
"maksimale mål."
